                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The cerberus attacks a single target with all three heads, overwhelming their foe. The cerberus Strikes with their jaws. On a successful attack, the cerberus deals an additional @Damage[2d6[piercing]] damage. On a failure (but not a critical failure), the cerberus deals @Damage[(1d6+4)[piercing]] damage to the target. This Strike counts as two attacks toward the cerberus's multiple attack penalty.</p>"
