                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A bite from the cerberus prevents creatures from escaping Hell. The target must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:24] saving throw or be unable to use teleportation effects or leave the plane in any other way for 1 minute. A holy creature takes a –2 circumstance penalty to this save. On a success, the target is temporarily immune to this curse for 24 hours.</p>"
